            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I royo acel, win mon wiripo yere gi cwogi win, ŋey ka moro kwoŋ jo jokiyey wac pa Were, kiti mon pajo mabeyo wonyali ywayo jo to joyeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole jobino neno paka kiti win olony aka diwor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋono mewin kiripi wok i gigipiny ma wiruko kosa witimo kwoŋ win paka kedo wic, kosa jaŋo kwoŋ win thiwino ma welo, kosa ruko nangin ma welo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel ŋono mewin ripo wok kwoŋ adieri ma cuny win, ŋono ma kirere ma cuny mamwol, m'okudere, manitie gi welo madwoŋ ruwaŋ Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole me a royo ma mon maleŋ, ma jogeno Were i ndir macon, joloko gine kwo pajo maŋon, aka jowinjo cwogi jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.18.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 18:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka Sara owinjo Abraham, munyo lwoŋo go ni Rwoth! Aka wibedo nyithindho pere ka witimo gim'otire ma wikibedo gi lworo moro je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
